2. **Fund attribution** [K]: KVision = $450M across Vietnam, Thailand, Indonesia, China, Israel. Vietnam allocation is a FRACTION. KBank total Vietnam plan = $336M for KVision across ALL activities including SME lending, not just startup equity. ([The Investor](https://theinvestor.vn/thailands-kasikornbank-eyes-to-invest-1-bln-in-vietnam-till-2027-d6385.html))

