4. **Deal credit ambiguity** [T]: Article credits Thành's KVision with Sendo ($61M), KiotViet ($40M). But these deals were done by KVision's investment committee in Thailand. Thành joined in 2020; Sendo Series C was 2019. He didn't DO these deals — he JOINED after them.

